What is Dual-pedal Foot Switch?
Dual-pedal Foot Switch is a hands‑free control device equipped with two independent foot‑operated pedals, designed to provide separate or coordinated electrical or mechanical control signals for industrial and professional equipment. It enables users to trigger two distinct functions or circuits by pressing either pedal individually or both together, freeing the operator’s hands while delivering stable, reliable and ergonomic actuation; the device typically features a rugged construction, non‑slip pedals and safety protection suitable for industrial, medical and mechanical applications.
